{"all_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Exponential function","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>实指数函数（real exponential function）定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\exp(x)=\\sum_{j=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^j}{j!},\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R.\n</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math inline\">e=\\exp(1)</span>，写成 <span class=\"math inline\">\\exp(x)=e^x</span>。一般的实指数函数 <span class=\"math inline\">a^x=\\exp(x\\ln a)</span> 要求底数（base）<span class=\"math inline\">a&gt;0</span>。</p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>函数</td>\n<td>function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数函数</td>\n<td>exponential function</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"calc.exponential-function.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"calc.exponential-function","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"指数函数"}],"anchors":["definition"],"articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"bibliography":[],"english_title":"Exponential function","external_links":[],"html":"<p><a id=\"definition\"></a></p>\n<p>实指数函数（real exponential function）定义为</p>\n<div class=\"math block\">\n\\exp(x)=\\sum_{j=0}^{\\infty}\\frac{x^j}{j!},\\qquad x\\in\\mathbb R.\n</div>\n<p>记 <span class=\"math inline\">e=\\exp(1)</span>，写成 <span class=\"math inline\">\\exp(x)=e^x</span>。一般的实指数函数 <span class=\"math inline\">a^x=\\exp(x\\ln a)</span> 要求底数（base）<span class=\"math inline\">a&gt;0</span>。</p>\n<h2>术语对照 / Terminology</h2>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>中文</th>\n<th>English</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>函数</td>\n<td>function</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>指数函数</td>\n<td>exponential function</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n","id":"calc.exponential-function.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"calc.exponential-function","resources":[],"schema_version":1,"title":"指数函数"}],"available_articles":[{"anchors":["definition"],"english_title":"Exponential function","id":"calc.exponential-function.main","legacy":true,"node_id":"ca